meta {
  name: Get Metric Points
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/metrics/points
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  resourceHash: 0000000000000000
  scopeName: my-meter
  instrumentName: http.server.duration
  kind: histogram
  ~from: 2026-05-19T00:00:00Z
  ~to: 2026-05-19T23:59:59Z
  ~includeAttributes: false
}

docs {
  I quattro identity field (`resourceHash`, `scopeName`, `instrumentName`,
  `kind`) selezionano una singola time series. `includeAttributes=true`
  espone la attribute map per ciascun punto (costo extra di
  serializzazione).
}
